      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The system is designed to prevent those small bits from vanishing, which is a huge concern, and it's all about rigorous documentation and third-party verification. Every single adjustment, no matter how small, is tied to a specific line item on the preliminary settlement statement. Before closing, the escrow agent performs a detailed reconciliation against all the invoices and contracts. If a tiny fee is missing or miscalculated, the system flags it immediately, much like a very diligent, highly organized accountant would spot a stray coin.",
